m1	120,390,1115,2248	PLAN OF KEYBOARD.	Plan of Colin Brown's keyboard: eight long vertical digitals in staggered rows, each marked along its length with note names such as C♯, b₂♯, D, c₂♯, E₁, F, G, A, B₁, down to C♭ and F♭.
67	290,2316,1628,2852	Fig. 67.	Perspective view of Mr. Colin Brown's Voice Harmonium keyboard: rows of white and shaded digitals lettered F, C, G, D, A, E, B, B♭, E♭, A♭, D♭, with round peg digitals standing between them.
